# ContactLogo web — local dev environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in values, OR run
# `npm run settings:pull` with INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID / INFISICAL_CLIENT_SECRET
# set to pull the ContactLogo project's app-level settings from Infisical
# (the sole source of truth — see INFISICAL.md at the repo root).
#
# These are build-time defaults inlined by Vite.  Anything a user types into
# the web Settings page is per-user (BYO keys) and lives in localStorage, not
# here — that boundary is documented in INFISICAL.md.  Never commit real values.
#
# --- Logo sources -----------------------------------------------------------
# Google OAuth client id for the Google Contacts import.
GOOGLE_CONTACTS_CLIENT_ID=
# Brandfetch Logo Link CDN client id (`?c=`).
BRANDFETCH_CLIENT_ID=
# Logo.dev image CDN token (`?token=`).  Secret — admin fills via Infisical.
LOGODEV_TOKEN=
#
# --- Observability ----------------------------------------------------------
# Sentry DSN for the web app.  Secret — admin fills via Infisical.
SENTRY_DSN=
SENTRY_ENV=
SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=
SENTRY_REPLAY_ENABLED=
SENTRY_REPLAY_SESSION_SAMPLE_RATE=
SENTRY_REPLAY_ERROR_SAMPLE_RATE=
# Datadog browser RUM.  Public client token, but still admin-filled via Infisical.
DD_APPLICATION_ID=
DD_CLIENT_TOKEN=
DD_SITE=
DD_SERVICE=
DD_ENV=
DD_VERSION=
DD_REQUIRE=
